      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Since 1972, the Caseville Historical Society has preserved the town’s heritage through exhibits, tours, and a growing archive of artifacts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        1,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://museumsdatabase.com/museums/view/15216",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every summer, Caseville hosts a 10‑day Cheeseburger in Caseville festival, a playful tribute to Jimmy Buffett’s song that began in 1999.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        27,
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
