      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caseville%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Caseville’s early economy thrived on lumber, shipbuilding, and salt manufacturing, with timber shipped across Lake Huron to distant markets.",
